      "content": "the mask thing is an okay analogy, but you keep using words like \"magical\" and \"talking.\" i'm trying to understand the actual physics part though. why did Einstein call it \"spooky action at a distance\"? was there something specific about the randomness or the measurement that felt so weird or unsettling to scientists?",
